      "message": "If so, then does it work if we make it takes recycled entry?\n\nE.g.\nfor (i \u003c size) {\n  getValues(int i, Entry r1)\n  generateFractionEntry(r2, underlyingIfaceTotal, tunIfaceTotal, r2);\n  for(iface in underlyingIface) {\n      generateFractionEntry(r2, perInterfaceTotal[iface], underlyingIfaceTotal, tmpEntry);\n      tmpEntry.iface \u003d iface;\n      ....\n   }\n}",
